From 955e90d35403c85d494587ef48e19f14bb284c7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tendai Makumire <121951760+tmakumire@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Apr 2025 11:06:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Initial board bringup of IMDT SBC8550 (#14)

This device tree manages to boot the
IMDT SBC8550 successfully with the
regulators enabled. The DT also bring up
the USB so that we have access to adb.
Therefore, this is now a good starting
point for bringing up the rest of the peripherals
on the board.

At some point we also need to investigate
how to make the USB-C with role-switching
so we can plug USB Video Cameras into
the SBC.
